<title>JAPAN: Toyo Engineering - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toyo Engineering - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 17.13		vs	   17.36</p>
<p> Operating	  140    million    vs	  205    million</p>
<p> Current	    153    million    vs	  203    million</p>
<p> Net		   71    million    vs	  114    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.24 yen	  vs	    5.18 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     22 million	  vs	  22 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toyo Engineering Works Ltd is a leading integrated specialist maker of freezers.</p>
</text>
